              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Business findings",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#020618",
                      "fontFamily": "'Instrument Sans', 'Segoe UI Semibold', sans-serif"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Sign-ups stopped on 25 Sep 2024. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "New buyers fell 128 (2023) to 64 (2024) to 28 (2025 YTD), and repeat orders are now 75% of orders. Confirm this is not an extract cut-off.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Profit is flat, not collapsing. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Like-for-like (Jan to Oct), gross profit fell 21% in 2024 and rose 6% in 2025. Active customers: 108, 84, 90.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Retention carries the business. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Recurring customers are 53% of buyers but earn 76% of gross profit (2.8x a one-time buyer). Second orders are slow: median 254 days.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. 80 registered customers never ordered. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "27% of the base. They look like buyers (same age and segment mix), so a first-order offer is cheap growth.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Discounts cost margin and buy no loyalty. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Margin is 30.4% with no item discount but 17.1% at 15%; 29 lines sold below cost. A discounted first order brings no extra repeat buying.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "6. Beauty leads, Home & Kitchen trails. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Beauty earns ₹76.5 L (27% of profit), Home & Kitchen ₹48.1 L. Serum is the top subcategory (₹22.3 L).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "7. Revenue leakage. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "19 cancelled or returned orders lost ₹52.3 L of sales and ₹12.0 L of profit (4.7% of orders), with no pattern by payment method.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "8. Maharashtra and Gujarat ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#682EFF"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "deliver 40% of gross profit, but repeat behaviour does not differ by state: volume is concentrated, behaviour is not.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
